    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya n'abasigaireho bali hamu na Gedaliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebbuzaradaani engabwa y'abalinzi obu yamazire kwikiriza Yeremiya aruge Rrama, kandi amutwaire aboherwe enjegere, hamu n'abakwatwa boona aba Yerusaalemu na Yuda abakaba nibazaahisibwa Bbabbulooni, kinu nikyo ekigambo MUKAMA eki yagambiire Yeremiya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engabwa y'abalinzi akagarra Yeremiya ha rubaju yamugambira ati, “MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe, ensi enu akagirangaho akabi, kanu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akaleesire, yakora nkooku yagambire. Eki muhikiirweho ekintu kinu, habwokuba mukasobeza MUKAMA mwayanga kumuhurra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati kiro kinu, ninkubohorraho empingo ezinyakukuli ha mikono. Obu oraaba noogonza kugenda na nyowe Bbabbulooni, ija tugende, ndikurolerra kurungi, baitu obu oraaba otarukugonza, oleke. Naga amaiso orole, ensi egi yoona ngigyo noogirora; genda hoona nambere hali harungi kandi nambere hasemeriire kugenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu oraaba noikara, garuka omba Gedaliya mutabani w'Ahikamu, mwijukuru wa Safani, omukama wa Bbabbulooni ou yafoire mulemi mukuru ow'embuga za Yuda, oikale nawe, hamu n'abantu abandi; rundi ogende handi nambere hasemeriire kugenda.” Engabwa y'abalinzi, nubwo yamuhaire ebyokulya n'ekisembo, yamuraga yagenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya yagenda Mizipa omba Gedaliya mutabani w'Ahikamu, yaikara nawe, hamu n'abantu abakaba bakyasigaire omunsi egi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
